OL,3,GNEWSACoroner set to deliver findings in
OL,4,ANoah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner is set to deliver the jury's
OL,7,Ffindings in the inquest into the death
OL,8,Fof Noah Donohoe
OL,10,FThe 14-year-old went missing after
OL,11,Fleaving his south Belfast home in June
OL,12,F2020, sparking extensive searches
OL,13,Facross the city
OL,15,FHis body was found nearly a week later
OL,16,Fin a tunnel system in north Belfast
OL,18,FA post-mortem examination concluded the
OL,19,Fcause of Noah's death was drowning
OL,21,FThe jury reached a unanimous verdict
OL,22,Fafter five days of deliberations
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
