OL,3,GNEWSACoroner set to deliver findings in
OL,4,ANoah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe initial deliberations were
OL,7,Fadjourned at the beginning of July to
OL,8,Ffacilitate summer holidays
OL,10,FThe inquest ran from January until the
OL,11,Fend of June 2026 after years of delay -
OL,12,Fit heard evidence from 76 witnesses and
OL,13,Fstatements from a further 42 people
